    "name": "NutriPlan API",
    "description": "<html><head></head><body><p>A unified API proxying TheMealDB, USDA, and OpenFoodFacts with normalized responses.</p>\n<h2 id=\"authentication\">Authentication</h2>\n<p>Nutrition endpoints require a USDA API key in the <code>x-api-key</code> header.\nGet your key at: <a href=\"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/api-key-signup.html\">https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/api-key-signup.html</a></p>\n</body></html>",
